  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1026.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1026.01 Purpose. The purpose of Env-Wq 1026 is to establish a schedule of fines in accordance with RSA 485-A:43, V for violations of the sewage disposal systems subdivision, RSA 485-A:29-44, any rule adopted pursuant to RSA 485-A:29-44, or any permit or approval issued under the authority of RSA 485-A:29-44.\n\nSource. #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1000.html"
